Package: symbolizer
Title: Structured Symbolic Specifications, Interpretations, and Teachable Stories for Modern Statistical Models
Version: 0.18.3
Authors@R: c(
    person("Shinichi", "Nakagawa", email = "itchyshin@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-7765-5182"))
  )
Description: Turns fitted distributional, multivariate, latent-variable,
    spatial, mixed-effect, meta-analytic, and additive models into structured
    symbolic specifications that render as publication-ready LaTeX equations,
    assumption tables, formula bridges, parameter interpretations,
    structural model comparisons, methods-section paragraphs, and structural
    DAGs. First-class methods for 'drmTMB', 'gllvmTMB', 'glmmTMB', 'brms',
    'lme4', 'MCMCglmm', 'sdmTMB', 'stats::lm' / 'stats::glm', 'metafor', and
    'mgcv'. Complementary to 'equatiomatic' for one-formula models.
